{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础：把「随机连通」讲成一门数学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-percolation","title":"为何渗流理论：随机介质中的连通性问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/foundations/why-percolation","wordCount":1850,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"connectivity-models","title":"键与位渗流模型：定义、格点与术语","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/foundations/connectivity-models","wordCount":1678,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"phase-transition","title":"相变直觉：连通性为何会骤然跳变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/foundations/phase-transition","wordCount":1660,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础-把-随机连通-讲成一门数学\">基础：把「随机连通」讲成一门数学</h1><p>在谈临界概率、临界指数这些精确结果之前，得先把问题本身讲清楚：渗流到底在问什么，用什么对象来建模，以及那个让所有人着迷的「突变」在直觉上为何必然发生。这一章不追求定理，只负责把语言和图像立起来。</p>\n<p>第一篇「为何渗流理论」从多孔介质、森林火灾、电网这些具体场景出发，说明渗流是「随机介质中的连通性」这一类问题的统一抽象，并交代它 1957 年的历史起点与在数学、物理、网络科学中的坐标。第二篇「键与位渗流模型」是本章的定义中枢：它精确区分键渗流（随机保留边）与位渗流（随机保留节点），铺开方格、三角、超立方等常见格点，并引入开/闭、团簇、贯通这些贯穿全 hub 的术语——后面各篇遇到模型细节都回指这里。第三篇「相变直觉」则单独讲那个核心现象：为什么连通性会在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 处骤然跳变，序参量、连续与不连续相变的区别，以及它与真实物理相变的类比。</p>\n<p>读完本章，你会具备进入 <a href=\"../critical/\">临界</a> 篇所需的全部词汇：临界篇负责把这里的「大约在某处突变」精确化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的数值与无穷团簇的定理。本章不碰精确临界值，也不碰指数，只求把直觉打牢。</p>\n"}